      en: ["The stadium was officially opened in 1992 for the Indian Ocean Island Games.", "It has a seating capacity of approximately 10,000 spectators.", "It served as the main venue for the 2011 Indian Ocean Island Games.", "An artificial turf pitch was installed in 2007 with FIFA support.", "The stadium is the home ground for the Seychelles national football team.", "It is located in the Roche Caiman district on the island of Mahé."],
