      en: ["Constructed in 1910 to improve maritime safety in the region.", "The lighthouse stands at a total height of about 27 meters.", "Located at the northernmost point of the Seychelles Bank.", "The original optical system was fueled by oil for several decades.", "The facility is now fully automated and requires no onsite keepers.", "A key visual landmark for vessels approaching the archipelago from the north."],
