      en: ["Commemorates Seychellois lives lost in World War I and World War II.", "Site of the annual Remembrance Sunday wreath-laying ceremony.", "Located in downtown Victoria, the capital of the Seychelles.", "Features plaques engraved with the names of fallen local soldiers.", "Represents the historical ties between the Seychelles and the Commonwealth.", "The memorial is surrounded by a quiet garden area for reflection."],
